--- !u!114 &5130834958718810138
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5559814552186868410}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3125c85e9da23194b857ccc15a3e00fb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  startingNode:
    npcSentence: Huh, a fresh pair of eyes? Nice to meet you! I am a Graphics Designer.
    playerOptions:
    - optionText: What do you work on?
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: 3D models, VFX, short films and more stuff
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: Do you work alone?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: 'Nah, we work in teams. That makes life easier, fun and
              also keeps us motivated to complete the stuff

'
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 29d89db1dc3dcbd4eb28c0bf0bb53703, type: 3}
        - optionText: Is that tough?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Only if you use a potato PC, might as well suggest carrying
              a fire extinguisher in that case.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: beff345a3c13d104a8fb6a850e51d5e8, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 19335b334de478f4f9af7c89b3e17fe1, type: 3}
    - optionText: How did you stumble across this?
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: Well I saw interstellar.
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: What??
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Basically, the black hole in that movie was 3D designed
              and the rendering was awesome.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 95082976f6dac5a45b59b230792685e4, type: 3}
        - optionText: Legit?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: "Nah, one day I just wanted to design an awesome castle,
              MS Paint couldn\u2019t but Blender did."
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1b8b042e669aa224d9c05968f01771f0, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4163e67a7df6dca46858d438f6bfa658, type: 3}
    - optionText: In general, what is the vibe in the club?
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: "Overall it\u2019s extremely chill, even our work meets are
          quite fun"
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: Are the seniors strict?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Nope, not unless you really decided to piss them off eh?
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe377d01beea84f4e8462d32801950f4, type: 3}
        - optionText: Is that the best part about the club?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Just behind the par- no yeah it is the best part.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8a7b60bef73735544b8c3cac625c5287, type: 3}
        - optionText: "Do you think there\u2019s a best portfolio?"
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: "Graphics, but we don\u2019t speak that out loud"
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48a9ab14c41cc254d968b5c97956d9c5, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e3fe837ef2070e542aadea570dba559a, type: 3}
    - optionText: Have you been doing that for a long time now?
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: If a year is long for you then yes i guess?
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: Only a year???
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: "It\u2019s easier to learn stuff while having fun, the best
              part of CGS I daresay."
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b9e58297c015d3a49ad14642ea5f0b66, type: 3}
        - optionText: You had no prior experience?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Not at all, you should take a look at my selection project.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40794880990269f4dbcb4135b97ba51c, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dacbff7d63d38944599c6bbe84c826be, type: 3}
    voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 486fbd93daebd6b429bb4592e8f6963f, type: 3}
